.TH ANNOTATION.WORKFLOW 2 2000-1月 "read_m8" "read_m8"
.SH NAME
read_m8 \- read the diamond m8 annotation table file output
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIread_m8(\fBfile\fR as string, 
\fBstream\fR as boolean = FALSE, 
\fBfilter\fR as string = "unknown", 
\fBparseHitId\fR as integer = -1, 
\fBhitIdDeli\fR as string = "|");\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
read the diamond m8 annotation table file output
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBfile\fB \fR\- 
 the file path of the diamond m8 format annotation table file.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBstream\fB \fR\- 
 read the table data in a lazy stream manner?
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBfilter\fB \fR\- 
 the keyword for filter the annotation result.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBparseHitId\fB \fR\- 
 the index number of the token in the hit id text for make the hit name 
 parse, a negative value means no parse.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBhitIdDeli\fB \fR\- 
 the delimiter character for split the hit id text.
. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a vector of the [DiamondAnnotation](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.Interops.NCBI.Extensions.DiamondAnnotation) diamond annotation 
 object, or a lazy pipeline collection of this data when the \fBstream\fR 
 parameter is TRUE.
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
annotation.workflow
